ls <host>.app/Contents/Library/SystemExtensions
```

Assertions consumed by `TASK-260715-3jloqy`, `TASK-260715-1r0fxv`,
`TASK-260715-9yp8to`, and `TASK-260715-uyju7n` (full text in
`verification.assertions` in the JSON):

| id | assertion |
| --- | --- |
| A1 | bundle identifier equals the matrix value exactly |
| A2 | provider identifier equals host identifier + `.tunnel` |
| A3 | NE entitlement equals the matrix array exactly — no extra provider values |
| A4 | `system-extension.install` present on macOS hosts only |
| A5 | `application-groups` equals the matrix array exactly |
| A6 | `keychain-access-groups` present only where status is `required` |
| A7 | the profile's `Entitlements` dict contains every required key with the same values |
| A8 | profile `TeamIdentifier` is `262RZ595FP` and `ApplicationIdentifierPrefix` is `["262RZ595FP"]` |
| A9 | every development profile's `ProvisionedDevices` contains this Mac |
